# Purple Dragon Punks: "{T}: Add {R}. Spend this mana only to cast an artifact spell or to activate an ability." (CR 106.6.)
# Turn 1: Bot1 casts Punks with the Moxen. Turn 3: tapping Punks puts one restricted {R} in the pool, and that mana casts
# Sol Ring, an artifact spell - the Moxen stay untapped, nothing else paid for it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Purple Dragon Punks
Sol Ring
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Purple Dragon Punks.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
